# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners.
# Owners can be @username, @org/team-name, or email addresses.
# 
# When a pull request modifies files matching a pattern, the owners
# are automatically requested for review.
#
# For multi-agent systems, this enables automated review assignment
# to ensure the right expertise reviews each change.

